    "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2021 gross claims outstanding decreased slightly to GBP 167.23m from opening gross reserves of GBP 168.97m, however the syndicate recorded a gross strengthening on prior year provisions of GBP 31.711m (18.8% of opening reserves). Management attribute the movement to adverse prior-year development across runoff and longtail classes (notably contingency-related prior years and casualty exposures) and ongoing uncertainty arising from the COVID19 pandemic which has affected reserves on older underwriting years.",
