      "On classes with material Covid-19 exposures, policy/contract level analysis is performed considering likelihood and severity of losses given emerging experience and market insight, with inputs from Underwriting/Claims.",
      "Margin is considered for exceptional reserves (such as large natural catastrophes such as hurricanes and Covid-19)"
